	<#bbbbbb>This move list assumes you are facing to the right.</>

	<#c63d3d>UNIQUE TRAIT: SPIRITUAL CHARGE</>
	Wu has a powered-up form that he can access by using
	any Remix Move. While he's charged, all of his special moves
	are more powerful and have enhanced properties. 
	He loses his charge whenever he gets knocked down.

	<#c63d3d>UNIQUE MOVES</>
DIVEKICK	-		<#65b5ff>(AIR ONLY)</> _D^B
DIVEKICK R	-		<#65b5ff>(AIR ONLY)</> _DB^B
DOUBLE KICK	-		_F^C
DUST KICK	-		_DF^C










