	UNIVERSAL MOVES
OVERHEAD	-		_F^B
   <#bbbbbb>Puts you in the air and hits overhead.</>
ANTI-AIR	-		_D^C
   <#bbbbbb>This move has invulnerability to projectiles and airborne enemies.</>
GRAB	-		ANY 2 NORMALS </>
   <#bbbbbb>Cannot be blocked. Starts combos on counter-hit.
   Enemies can break this by pressing ^A/^B/^C.</>
FORCE BLOCK (WHILE BLOCKING)	-		<#55ffff>(1 BAR)</> _B^X
   <#bbbbbb>Can push the enemy backwards while you block.</>
NO PARRY	-		<#aaffff>(GROUND OR AIR)</><#55ffff>(1 BAR)</> _F^X
   <#bbbbbb>A reversal option that makes you invincible if the enemy hits you.
   Can be used again FOR FREE while the invincibility is active.</>
RECORD SCRATCH (WHILE ATTACKING)		<#55ffff>(1 BAR/2 BARS ON BLOCK)</> ^X
   <#bbbbbb>Can be used to instantly cancel most attacks.
   Holding any direction during this will cause you to move that way.</>
BURST (WHILE GETTING HIT)	-		^X+^A/^B/^C
   <#bbbbbb>A large reversal that can be used while you're getting hit.</>
PANIC BURST (WHILE GETTING HIT)	-		<#55ffff>(5 BARS)</> ^X+^A/^B/^C
   <#bbbbbb>An extra burst that can be used in an emergency.</>
   <#ff0000>Using this PERMANENTLY lowers your max meter
   for the rest of the game.</>
